body:
The `fetchData` useCallback hook is missing `dataConfig` from its dependency array (line 261). The function uses `dataConfig` on lines 208-210, but `dataConfig` is computed outside the callback on line 101. This could lead to stale closure issues where the callback uses an outdated version of `dataConfig` when the schema changes.

Either add `dataConfig` to the dependency array or compute it inside the callback using `getDataConfig(schema)` since `schema` is already in the dependencies.
```suggestion
  }, [schema, dataSource, hasInlineData, dataConfig]);
```
